WEBVTT

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.530
<b>Muginami! That's dangerous!</b>

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.290
<b>Lan, you're so slow!</b>

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:20.750
<b>Why you—!</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.920
<b><i>Out of the way! Out of the way!</i></b>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:33.760
<b>Madoka!</b>

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:35.340
<b>Now you've done it!</b>

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.100
<b>Whoops, sorry!</b>

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:42.270
<b>Muginami!</b>

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:43.770
<b>Roger that!</b>

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.110
<b>Here we go, Midori!</b>

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:52.570
<b>They're as agile as cats.</b>

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:56.570
<b>It's mostly due to their crafts' capabilities.</b>

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:00.160
<b>Even so, standard fighter planes are no match for them now.</b>

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Uehara!</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.840
<b>Tell those three not to to fly into space.</b>

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:13.130
<b>Yes sir!</b>

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:19.800
<b>It's a good thing that Villagiulio hasn't made any moves lately.</b>

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:23.100
<b>However, we can't expect him to leave quietly.</b>

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.270
<b>You're right about that.</b>

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:26.190
<b>Cap, you have an outside call.</b>

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.060
<b>Okay...</b>

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:29.650
<b>This is Pharos, Tadokoro speaking.</b>

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:31.400
<b>What?</b>

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.820
<b>At what time?{nice animation derp}</b>

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:36.570
<b>That means he's practically here!</b>

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.660
<b><i>Calling all Vox Units. Return to base immediately!</i></b>

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:41.580
<b>Return to base?</b>

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:44.410
<b><i>What? But we were just starting to have fun!</i></b>

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:45.910
<b><i>Just get back here stat!</i></b>

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:46.870
<b>Mr. Tadokoro?</b>

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:48.880
<b>The chairman will arrive at Pharos shortly!</b>

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:50.420
<b>What chairman?</b>

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:53.380
<b><i>Our boss, the chairman of Novumundus!</i></b>

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:55.670
<b>The chairman...?</b>

