00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:31.640
<b>A Lolita in Kamogawa</b>

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.080
<b>Where's Tadokoro?</b>

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:51.710
<b>That would be me.</b>

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.420
<b>So you are Tadokoro Shouzou?</b>

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:02.090
<b>Asteria Lizamarie De Roschefall...</b>

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:03.720
<b>I'll be representing my great-grandfather.</b>

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:04.970
<b>Representing him?</b>

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:08.470
<b>He's getting older and doesn't like to travel long distances.</b>

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.310
<b>But we didn't receive any notice.</b>

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.890
<b>Was that necessary?</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:15.400
<b>Oh no... I guess it wasn't really...</b>

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.480
<b>Mr. Tadokoro looks uncomfortable.</b>

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.980
<b>She's clearly overwhelming him.</b>

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.820
<b>And you're the Vox pilots?</b>

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:26.660
<b>Woof.</b>

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.660
<b>You still do that?</b>

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.540
<b>It's a greeting.</b>

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:35.790
<b>I was lying when I said that was a greeting on Earth.</b>

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:37.920
<b>A lie?</b>

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.340
<b>You're Kyouno Madoka?</b>

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.510
<b>Huh? Uh, yes.</b>

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:45.260
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.520
<b>You're so-so...</b>

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.310
<b>What?</b>

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:57.310
<b>I think you'll make good scissors.{... really?}</b>

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.610
<b>Scissors?</b>

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:04.400
<b>You should have received detailed reports already.</b>

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.110
<b>Is there anything that concerns you?</b>

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:09.490
<b>No, I've been briefed quite thoroughly.</b>

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:13.500
<b>But I wanted to hear everything directly from the people that were involved.</b>

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:17.380
<b>I wonder if Lan has met Asteria before.</b>

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:18.540
<b>It seems so.</b>

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:22.090
<b>She was the one who taught Lan about the customs on Earth.</b>

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:22.960
<b>But...</b>

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.630
<b>It was a lie. "Woof" was a lie.</b>

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:26.470
<b>"Woof" was a lie.</b>

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.180
<b>Kyouno Madoka.</b>

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:39.560
<b>Tell me in your own words what happened during this incident.</b>

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:44.030
<b>Well, I don't remember very clearly...</b>

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:47.320
<b>But... well, we were having a little argument.</b>

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:51.370
<b>I lost my temper and got upset with Muginami and...</b>

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:52.700
<b>An argument?</b>

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.200
<b>Tadokoro...</b>

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:57.420
<b>The report I received said the cause was due to differences</b>

00:05:57.420 --> 00:06:00.420
<b>in tactical decisions made during an extreme battle situation.</b>

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.710
<b>No, that was...</b>

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:06.220
<b>So, to be more precise, these girls were fighting amongst themselves during a mission.</b>

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:08.050
<b>Is that correct?</b>

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:09.800
<b>Yes.</b>

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:10.550
<b>Wait!</b>

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.350
<b>Let me explain.</b>

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.640
<b>It was a very important and sensitive problem.</b>

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:17.480
<b>What kind of problem was it?</b>

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:21.940
<b>Well, basically, it was about love.</b>

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:26.570
<b>Very well.</b>

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:28.240
<b>You may all go.</b>

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:39.500
<b>Who would've thought a girl like her would bring the legend to life?</b>

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:47.970
<b>Lan, let's get on.</b>

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:50.630
<b>Madoka...</b>

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:53.970
<b>Would you mind coming with me?</b>

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:55.260
<b>Huh?</b>

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:15.370
<b>You're usually not one to take a detour home.</b>

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:16.870
<b>I know.</b>

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.540
<b>Don't you want to tell Madoka something?</b>

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:23.710
<b>You tend to be awkward about these things.</b>

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:24.840
<b>Is that right?</b>

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.050
<b>I'm concerned about something.</b>

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.670
<b>Concerned?</b>

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:31.010
<b>The Vox Legend.</b>

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:37.890
<b>Anyway, I want a wider circuit laid between here and NORAD immediately.</b>

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.850
<b>What are you crying about?</b>

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.730
<b>You know you can be easily replaced.</b>

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.150
<b>By any chance, is the person on the other end of the line...</b>

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.150
<b><i>If you want to retain your position,</i></b>

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.900
<b>It's the President of the United States.</b>

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.900
<b><i>listen to what I say.</i></b>

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.110
<b>My apologies, Miss Nakaizumi.</b>

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:52.410
<b>Not at all.</b>

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.070
<b>What do you think of this place?</b>

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:58.080
<b>I never imagined Pharos having a room like this.</b>

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:02.250
<b>I made them use lots of aged mahogany and oak.</b>

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:09.050
<b>I believe that being surrounded by steel and plastic corrupts a person.</b>

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:10.550
<b>I see...</b>

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:13.510
<b><i>Is she really younger than me?</i></b>

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:20.220
<b>I asked you to come here in order to exchange information about Vox.</b>

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.350
<b>The Vox Legend?</b>

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.310
<b>Have you heard about it, Muginami?</b>

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:28.270
<b>You mean the scary story about Vox?</b>

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.230
<b>Yes.</b>

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.690
<b>What is it about?</b>

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:34.410
<b>I just know that a story exists.</b>

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:40.580
<b>20,000 years ago, civilization on Earth collapsed.</b>

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:54.800
<b>As an archaeologist, what is your assessment of what the world was like 20,000 years ago?</b>

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:57.760
<b>That would fall under the Last Glacial Maximum.</b>

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:01.810
<b>However, there are no archaeological traces from that period.</b>

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.310
<b>Thus, you can't analyze it?</b>

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:09.230
<b>Not too long ago, my answer would have been "Yes."</b>

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.730
<b>But the truth is different.</b>

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:17.450
<b>20,000 years ago, a superior civilization existed on earth.</b>

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:24.250
<b>We are the descendants of those who left Earth back then.</b>

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.170
<b>I see.</b>

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.380
<b>So in a way, you and Muginami are both from this planet.</b>

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:32.510
<b>Aren't you shocked?</b>

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:34.380
<b>Yeah, I am.</b>

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.510
<b>But also a little disappointed.</b>

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.930
<b>I mean, if you're both earthlings,</b>

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.850
<b>this is just like coming home for you.</b>

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:45.350
<b>Huh? Coming home?</b>

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:45.350
<b>They're so talented!</b>

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:52.070
<b>Anyway, our ancestors left this planet 20,000 years ago after a great war took place.</b>

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:54.530
<b>It was because the Vox had lost control,</b>

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:56.650
<b>nearly destroying the world.</b>

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.700
<b>The giant green demon will rip the heavens...</b>

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.750
<b>The giant blue demon will devour the stars...</b>

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.710
<b>The giant orange demon will spew out darkness...</b>

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.630
<b>Through countless sacrifices, they will rule the land.</b>

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:15.010
<b>Feeding off a tainted heart, they awaken from within the mind.</b>

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.130
<b>The demons shall then rise.</b>

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:20.720
<b>This poem has been passed down for generations in Le Garite.</b>

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:23.310
<b>When I was little, my older brother</b>

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:26.730
<b>used to scare me by saying that the giant blue demon was going to eat me up.</b>

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:29.900
<b>A giant blue demon...</b>

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:32.110
<b>Is that like the bogeyman?</b>

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:39.570
<b>New nations were established in a faraway galaxy,</b>

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:43.990
<b>and a pact was signed to preserve Earth, Man's birthplace.</b>

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:48.580
<b>We established Earth as an inviolable neutral territory,</b>

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:51.750
<b>and severed all contact with those who remained.</b>

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:52.750
<b>For what purpose?</b>

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:56.260
<b>We feared that the Circle of Rin-ne forged by the Vox</b>

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:59.510
<b>would once again destroy the world.</b>

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:03.680
<b>Wait...</b>

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:07.350
<b>If that's what happened, then why did you two come to this planet?</b>

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:12.350
<b>The situation has changed and the Vox has become necessary again.</b>

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:14.190
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:18.860
<b>But this has served to revive the legend as well.</b>

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:20.900
<b>The legend...</b>

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.240
<b>This is all very interesting.</b>

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:27.370
<b>But I don't know what I can do.</b>

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:31.370
<b>You are an archaeologist and have researched the Vox for a long time.</b>

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:36.090
<b>We'd like you to shed some new light on this legend from your vantage point.</b>

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.010
<b>I'm not a fan of science fiction.</b>

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.180
<b>Let me put it this way then.</b>

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:47.680
<b>A child who ran away because of familial strife now returns only to claim his inheritance.</b>

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.020
<b>What would you do if you were the parent?</b>

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:52.690
<b>I'd give him a good punch.</b>

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:55.440
<b>I'm glad we agree!</b>

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.570
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:19.800
<b>The giant blue demon...</b>

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.340
<b>Madoka, are you still awake?</b>

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:26.640
<b>Lan? Yeah, come in.</b>

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:32.020
<b>Can I sleep here tonight?</b>

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:33.100
<b>Huh?</b>

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:34.900
<b>Sure, but what's wrong?</b>

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:39.400
<b>I thought you might be scared.</b>

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:40.320
<b>Huh?</b>

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.950
<b>I bet you're the one who's actually scared.</b>

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.030
<b>Am not!</b>

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:49.160
<b>You remembered the scary story from this afternoon and got frightened, didn't you?</b>

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.410
<b>Really?</b>

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:53.290
<b>Don't be silly! I'm not a child!</b>

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:54.330
<b>Look! A demon!</b>

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:55.580
<b>No!</b>

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:56.380
<b>Huh?</b>

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.920
<b>There, there, little Lan.{So much FRIENDSHIP this episode}</b>

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:05.430
<b>You don't have to be afraid anymore.</b>

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:10.140
<b>Midori isn't a demon, right?</b>

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:17.400
<b>The first time I touched Midori, I had this nostalgic feeling.</b>

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:22.820
<b>I think I might have known Midori from before.</b>

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:29.030
<b>I believe that meeting Midori was fate.</b>

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.450
<b>I love things like that. It's so poetic.</b>

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.120
<b>It's illogical.</b>

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:36.500
<b>And demons are logical?</b>

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.380
<b>Shall we hit the hay?</b>

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.590
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:41.880
<b>Good night.</b>

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.550
<b>What are you afraid of?</b>

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:51.140
<b>Do I look scared?</b>

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.430
<b>If the legend is true...</b>

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:57.640
<b>This time, the Earth may really be destroyed.</b>

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.690
<b>That's why I want your help.</b>

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:04.740
<b>To prevent the tragedy that occurred 20,000 years ago from repeating itself.</b>

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.410
<b>As of this moment,</b>

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.830
<b>all operations associated with Vox Aura are to be put on hold.</b>

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:18.460
<b>I am banning Kyouno Madoka from piloting Aura.</b>

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:19.630
<b>What?</b>

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:21.000
<b>Why is that?</b>

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:24.510
<b>Is it because I might cause Midori to lose control again?</b>

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:25.590
<b>Yes, exactly.</b>

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:26.760
<b>But...!</b>

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.590
<b>Please rescind your orders!</b>

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:29.760
<b>Lan...</b>

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:34.930
<b>You based your decision on a groundless legend that's never been proven.</b>

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:37.600
<b>I agree with Lan!</b>

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:40.350
<b>What's wrong with piloting Midori?</b>

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.230
<b>You two...</b>

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.690
<b>If you know the legend surrounding the Vox,</b>

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:46.610
<b>I shouldn't have to explain.</b>

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:52.660
<b>The continued operation of Aura poses a risk that cannot be ignored.</b>

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.740
<b>Begging your pardon,</b>

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:57.750
<b>but we don't stand a fighting chance without Aura.</b>

00:14:58.250 --> 00:14:59.710
<b>Please reconsider.</b>

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:00.830
<b>Request denied.</b>

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:07.300
<b>Set up a defense strategy immediately centered on Vox Lympha and Ignis.</b>

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.260
<b>But...!</b>

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:11.640
<b>This is the decision reached by the Novumundus High Council.</b>

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.390
<b>It will not be changed.</b>

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:21.310
<b>There won't be a resounding "success" this time around.</b>

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.730
<b>What will you do, Madoka?</b>

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.150
<b>Cap, it's Kyouno.</b>

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:30.860
<b>Oh, you're here.</b>

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.070
<b>Mr. Tadokoro, what's this all about?</b>

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.910
<b>Laffinty and Muginami are responsible.</b>

