00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:44.590
<b>until we rescind the orders to shutdown Aura.</b>

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.090
<b>What? Why are those two doing this?</b>

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.590
<b>Didn't you put them up to it?</b>

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:54.050
<b>I didn't think so.</b>

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:57.680
<b>Well, those two are going the extra mile for you.</b>

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:02.190
<b>Lan... Muginami...</b>

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.480
<b>Just what is all this nonsense?</b>

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:08.730
<b>It's exactly as you see.</b>

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:12.240
<b>They're just like children whose toys were confiscated.</b>

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.280
<b>It's no use, Cap.</b>

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:17.240
<b>All entries have been locked from the inside and we can't access them.</b>

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.120
<b>I'll go in and talk to them.</b>

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:20.950
<b>What?</b>

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.750
<b>We can't let this go on, can we?</b>

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:25.250
<b>How do you intend to get in?</b>

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:27.960
<b>From there!</b>

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:35.220
<b>I'm amazed that you thought of this.</b>

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:38.220
<b>You didn't have to come along.</b>

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:39.970
<b>Don't mind me.</b>

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:43.980
<b>It's the parent's job to spank children who don't listen.</b>

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:46.770
<b>Oww!</b>

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.270
<b>Why did you do that?</b>

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:53.150
<b>Why didn't you go along with them?</b>

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:53.700
<b>Huh?</b>

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:57.950
<b>I was certain that if anyone tried to do something, it would be you.</b>

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.910
<b>I'm in too much pain to think of an answer.</b>

