A

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:08.000
SAY NO TO THE
 SHUTDOWN OF 
\hVOX AURA!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.000
<b><i>Hurry up and go!</i></b>

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.000
<b><i>Hey, wait! Don't push!</i></b>

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.050
A

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.050
SAY NO TO THE
 SHUTDOWN OF 
\hVOX AURA!

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:13.420
<b>Madoka?</b>

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:14.680
<b>Ouch...</b>

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:17.720
<b>Hey Lan... Muginami...</b>

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:21.060
<b>That was quite an unusual experience.</b>

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:26.310
<b>Can't we ask you to reconsider?</b>

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:30.190
<b>Madoka and Aura are both essential to our team.</b>

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.320
<b>I'd be uneasy with just Lan with me.</b>

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:34.570
<b>What is that supposed to mean?</b>

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.070
<b>Well, you know...</b>

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:39.200
<b>Listen, you two. Let's stop this.</b>

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:41.410
<b>Madoka?</b>

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:42.700
<b>Madoka?</b>

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:45.660
<b>I really appreciate what you're doing,</b>

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.500
<b>but this isn't the right way.</b>

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.760
<b>But that means we won't be able to fly together anymore.</b>

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:58.470
<b>It would be terrible if what happened last time repeated itself.</b>

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.140
<b>If it does, I'll stop it.</b>

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:02.510
<b>What if it doesn't stop?</b>

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.770
<b>I'll make it stop!</b>

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:08.940
<b>That's what Madoka of the Jersey Club would say.</b>

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:09.860
<b>Yeah, yeah!</b>

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:14.990
<b>Perhaps, but not this time.</b>

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:20.070
<b>The thought of you two getting hurt because of me is even worse.</b>

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:23.490
<b>I don't have the confidence to promise that it won't lose control again.</b>

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:26.080
<b>I'm just not that strong.</b>

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.420
<b>Besides, even if I can't pilot Midori,</b>

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:33.170
<b>it's not like you and Lan are going away.</b>

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.300
<b>Right, Ms. Chairman?</b>

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:38.550
<b>Is that the answer to my earlier question?</b>

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:42.180
<b>Maybe it is.</b>

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:45.930
<b>I only ordered Aura to be grounded.</b>

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:48.890
<b>Then I'll accept that decision.</b>

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:52.560
<b>Even if I can't pilot Midori, nothing will change between us.</b>

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:07.700
<b>Thank you. I'll be okay.</b>

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.830
<b>We will always be the Kamo Girls' Jersey Club.</b>

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.710
<b>Madoka...</b>

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.710
<b>Madoka!</b>

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:19.590
<b>Now I feel so stupid for doing this.</b>

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.720
<b>Don't be.</b>

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.470
<b>It made me really happy.{Madoka going for harem route}</b>

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.540
<b>"Disregard it"?{that green chair ;A;}</b>

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:58.510
<b>Are you saying you'll overlook everything regarding this incident?</b>

00:19:58.510 --> 00:19:59.420
<b>Yes.</b>

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.550
<b>But it was a serious violation of service regulations.</b>

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:06.810
<b>This is my decision as the representative of the Novumundus High Council.</b>

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:13.150
<b>By the way, how are the preparations to equip Lympha and Ignis proceeding?</b>

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.440
<b>"Equip"?</b>

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.730
<b>Check it out immediately and get it done.</b>

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:18.900
<b>Yes, I will.</b>

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:22.200
<b>I'm going out. Get the ship ready.</b>

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.320
<b>Ship?</b>

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:25.120
<b>You are coming too.</b>

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:26.240
<b>Huh?</b>

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:31.620
<b>Yes, Your Highness.</b>

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:36.380
<b>We must be even more wary of the actions of those who oppose</b>

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.340
<b>the blossoming of the Circle of Rin-ne.</b>

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:43.050
<b>In fact, since Villagiulio is openly taking action,</b>

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:45.180
<b>we cannot waste any time whatsoever.</b>

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:51.180
<b><i>Very well. Then speed up the retrieval schedule for the Vox units as much as you can.</i></b>

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:53.270
<b>As you wish, sir.</b>

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:56.150
<b><i>Isn't it ironic, Moid?</i></b>

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.060
<b>Sir?</b>

00:20:57.060 --> 00:21:03.150
<b><i>The light moves so slowly, but time cruelly pushes us forward.</i></b>

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:12.370
<b>Array...</b>

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:13.370
<b>What the—!</b>

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.870
<b>Don't look at me like that.</b>

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:17.380
<b>I mean, just don't look, damn it!</b>

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:19.290
<b>Didn't I tell you?</b>

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:23.380
<b>He's the personal maid for the chairman of Novumundus.</b>

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:24.800
<b>Maid?</b>

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.300
<b>But he's a guy...</b>

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:27.640
<b>A lot of things happened.</b>

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.720
<b>So what is your answer?</b>

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:33.770
<b>The answer is no.</b>

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:36.190
<b>We will not hand over the Vox to you.</b>

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.310
<b>What? Are you sure?</b>

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:40.110
<b>You'll live to regret it.</b>

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:48.320
<b>The Flower of Lagrange must never be allowed to blossom again.</b>

